{
 "meta": {
  "title": "Pattern drills",
  "why": "Memorised sentences make you a phrasebook. Fluency is generating sentences you have never said before, fast. Each pattern is a frame with a slot; the drill fills the slot at random and asks you to produce the whole sentence under time pressure. 32 patterns x ~9 fillers is roughly 290 sentences you build rather than recall — and the frame transfers to any word you learn later.",
  "license": "CC0"
 },
